<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p><strong>ChromaDB</strong></p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p><strong>Justification for Face Recognition </strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Scalability Limit</p></td>
